Relationships:
-------------
RDG_MasterOp --> SID_Structure      (uses geometry definitions)
RDG_MasterOp --> SID_Interaction    (uses relational tensions)
RDG_MasterOp --> SID_Dynamics       (uses dynamic evolution rules)

SID_Structure --> RDG_State         (creates structural basis)
SID_Interaction --> RDG_State       (modifies relational tensions)
SID_Dynamics --> RDG_State          (updates flux + motion)

Notes:
------
* SID_Structure defines the relational geometry.
* SID_Interaction defines how geometry responds to tension.
* SID_Dynamics defines how states evolve over time.
* RDG_MasterOp composes all three into a unified relational operator.
